    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Previous NetZoo goal: To find which regulators drive the inflammatory phenotype in 45 psoriasis skin biopsies, I'd like to estimate how active each transcription factor is in each biopsy, inferred from its targets rather than its own transcript level, along with whether it switches each target on or off. I have the expression, a TF-gene motif prior and TF-TF interactions.\nUser follow-up: Yes"
